  << /ActualText (PERSONAL PROJECTS\nWeb Portfolio\nI developed a first portfolio with basic HTML and CSS\056\nI updated my portfolio\072 converted the basic code into a modern React project using Opencode\056\nI rigorously guided the AI\054 generating the AGENTS\056md with the specifications\054 requirements\054 and necessary limits\056\nI supervised the AI\047s efforts\054 verifying everything on my own\056\n \nWeb design and responsive design with HMTL and CSS\056\nI put my general HTML\054 CSS\054 and responsive design knowledge into practice\056\n\nE\055commerce development with database and Firebase authentication\nI developed an e\055commerce application in React\056\nI created a database and authentication methods with Firebase service\056\nI implemented state management with Redux\056\nI converted the application into a Single Page Application using React Router\056\nI used Sass for more organized styles\056\nI developed a responsive interface that adapts to different devices\056\nI deployed the application through Vercel\056\n\nApp prototypes and designs \050UX\057UI\051\nWireframes for \042SingOut\042 app\056\nWireframes for \042Eat\046Shopping\042 app\056\nWireframes for a web catalog for a small real Mexican company\056\nApp prototype\056)
